{% include 'header.twig' %}

<title>Privacy Policy</title>


  
			 <!-- Main variables *content* -->
			 <main  >
				 <section id="page_top_banner">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <div class="page__title__all">
                    <h1>Privacy Policy of {{ site["site_name"] }}</h1>
                    <p>
                        Welcome to {{ site["site_name"] }}'s Privacy Policy page. Your privacy and the security of your personal
                        information are of paramount importance to us. This policy outlines how we collect, use,
                        protect, and handle your data in compliance with international standards and local
                        government regulations.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section id="terms_content">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-12">
                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Information Collection and Use</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Personal Data:</strong> We collect personal information such as name, email
                        address, and contact
                        details when you sign up for our services or interact with us via email or social media.
                        This information is used to personalize your experience, provide customer service, and
                        send updates about our services.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Usage Data:</strong> We gather non-personally identifiable information such as
                        browser
                        type, device type, and browsing activity to understand how our services are used and to
                        improve our website's functionality.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Data Protection and Security</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Secure Handling:</strong> All personal data is securely stored and protected
                        against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction. We employ various
                        security measures including encryption, firewalls, and secure server hosting.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Third-Party Sharing:</strong> We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your
                        personally identifiable information to outside parties, except as necessary to provide
                        our services (e.g., payment processing). These third parties agree to keep this
                        information confidential.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Use of Cookies:</strong> Our website uses "cookies" to enhance user experience.
                        Cookies are small files transferred to your device's hard drive through your web browser
                        (if you allow) that enable our systems to recognize your browser and capture certain
                        information.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Analytics and Optimization:</strong> We also use third-party services, like
                        Google Analytics, to understand our site's usage and improve our services accordingly.
                    </p>
                </div>


                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ User Rights and Control</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Access and Control:</strong> You have the right to access,
                        update, or request deletion of your personal data at any time. Please contact us for
                        assistance.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Opt-Out Options: </strong>Users can set their web browser to refuse cookies or
                        to alert you when cookies are being sent. However, some parts of our site may not
                        function properly without them.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-12">
                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Disclaimer</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Limitations:</strong> While we strive to use commercially
                        acceptable means to protect your data, no method of transmission over the Internet, or
                        method of electronic storage, is 100% secure. Therefore, we cannot guarantee its
                        absolute security.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong> External Links:</strong> Our website may contain links to external
                        sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these other sites and
                        encourage you to read their privacy statements.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Child Privacy Policy</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Age Restriction:</strong> Our services are not intended for individuals under
                        the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18.
                        If we learn that we have collected personal information from a child under 18, we will
                        take steps to delete the information as soon as possible.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Compliance with Local Government Policies</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Local Laws and Regulations:</strong> We adhere to the local government policies
                        of Bangladesh and other regions we operate in. This includes any requirements for data
                        protection, user privacy, and online conduct.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <strong>Updates and Modifications:</strong> We may update our Privacy Policy from time
                        to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this
                        page and updating the "last updated" date.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="tems_items">
                    <h3>✅ Contact Us</h3>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        For any questions or concerns regarding our Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact-us"
                            class="home_link">contact us</a>. Learn
                        more about our approach and services on our <a href="/about-us" class="home_link">About Us</a>
                        page.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
			 </main>












